// Steps are written against the expected Guide-role login flow and page structure
// documented in RequirementAnalysis.md/FunctionalTestCases.md/UITestCases.md, routed
// through withHeal() inside guide-portal.page.ts so a first real run with genuine
// Guide-role credentials self-heals and logs drift rather than silently asserting
// against a locator nobody has ever confirmed exists.
//
// "User is logged in as {string}" is already defined identically by the AUTH/DASH/
// INVOICE/WAIVER clusters' own steps files and intentionally NOT redefined here (see
